    "description": "<p id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" data-placeholder=\"Traducci&oacute;n\"><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"en\">Add +[(SR)D] to [weapon attack] damage rolls with the [Katana] tag. You can acquire this skill multiple times, but each time must be under a different name with its own separate SR. &nbsp;Each attack cannot receive the effect of more than one &laquo;Weapon Mastery&raquo; at a time.</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p>You are good at handling swords.</p>",
